{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Play the demo and dive into tactical chaos!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This demo includes the <strong>first two levels</strong> of a game that blends <strong>hack and slash action</strong> with <strong>tower defense strategy</strong>, fully available in <strong>English and Spanish</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2694\ufe0f Choose from <strong>two playable characters</strong>: a swift swordsman or a deadly archer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udc7e Face off against <strong>4 different enemy types</strong>, each with unique behaviors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udff0 Build smart: place and upgrade <strong>8 types of defensive structures</strong> with <strong>15 unique upgrades</strong> to unlock.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udca5 Power up your heroes with over <strong>30 character upgrades</strong> to suit your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\uddd9\u200d\u2642\ufe0f Need backup? You\u2019ll have <strong>4 powerful allies</strong> to support you in battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get ready to fight, build, defend\u2026 and uncover the truth behind a mysterious artifact that could change everything.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3776100?t=1750610532","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3776100?t=1750610532","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776100/aad27c931dfbeeec7c0d8c34c342e6e4fbc830f8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750610532","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776100/aad27c931dfbeeec7c0d8c34c342e6e4fbc830f8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750610532","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls",